</section>

<div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true"><div class="tr" id="ticker"></div></div>

<section class="sec" data-shape="skyline" data-shape-x="0" data-shape-y=".05" data-shape-s="1.15" data-shape-a=".55" data-shape-ma=".35">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div><span class="label rv">Who we are</span><h2 class="title split">Dedicated, experienced, <em>reliable.</em></h2></div>
      <p class="lead rv d1">We help you find your perfect property or investment opportunity, and we deliver top-notch real estate services from the first call to the handover and beyond.</p>
